    FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER
    DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.

    HttpServer::stop() drains HTTP/3 sessions (qore#5899): each session is sent a GOAWAY notice, the requests in
    progress are answered, and each session is closed when its requests end; stop() ends when the last session of the
    listener is closed, without waiting for the drain timeout.  The test synchronizes on the handler and on the
    server's log messages, never on time.
*/

